{"id":12086,"date":"2024-03-19T12:02:51","date_gmt":"2024-03-19T12:02:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12086"},"modified":"2024-03-19T12:02:51","modified_gmt":"2024-03-19T12:02:51","slug":"kontrola-kvality-3d-laseroveho-mikrotisku-pomoci-ir-snom-nanoskopie","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/kontrola-kvality-3d-laseroveho-mikrotisku-pomoci-ir-snom-nanoskopie\/","title":{"rendered":"Kontrola kvality 3D laserov\u00e9ho mikrotisku pomoc\u00ed IR-SNOM nanoskopie"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Ned\u00e1vn\u00e9 pokroky v\u00a0oblasti <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>3D laserov\u00e9ho mikrotisku<\/strong><\/span> (micro-manufacturing, micro additive manufacturing, Micro AM) umo\u017e\u0148uj\u00ed rychlou a reprodukovatelnou v\u00fdrobu objekt\u016f komplikovan\u00fdch tvar\u016f o velikostech v\u00a0rozsahu 50 \u2013 100 nanometr\u016f. Ide\u00e1ln\u00edm stavebn\u00edm materi\u00e1lem se pro mnoho aplikac\u00ed tohoto typu 3D tisku jako jev\u00ed nap\u0159. tzv. blokov\u00e9 kopolymery.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Blokov\u00e9 kopolymery<\/strong> jsou velmi atraktivn\u00ed materi\u00e1ly, a to d\u00edky sv\u00e9mu potenci\u00e1lu vytv\u00e1\u0159et samoorganizovan\u00e9 struktury s dom\u00e9nami o velikosti jednotek a\u017e stovek nanometr\u016f. Jsou velmi slibn\u00fdmi kandid\u00e1ty pro r\u016fzn\u00e9 modern\u00ed aplikace, od membr\u00e1nov\u00fdch proces\u016f, farmacii, elektroniku a\u017e po \u0161ablony (templates, knitting patterns atd.) pro nanov\u00fdrobu. Jsou velmi dob\u0159e prozkoum\u00e1ny ve form\u011b tenk\u00fdch vrstev, ale zat\u00edm ne jako slo\u017eit\u011bj\u0161\u00ed 3D struktury. Tvorba podobn\u00fdch struktur pro budouc\u00ed pr\u016fmyslovou kontrolu samoz\u0159ejm\u011b vy\u017eaduje spolehlivou analytickou techniku, a v n\u011bkter\u00fdch p\u0159\u00edkladech pou\u017eit\u00ed pouze klasick\u00e9 skenovac\u00ed elektronov\u00e9 mikroskopie nen\u00ed dosta\u010duj\u00edc\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p>V\u00a0n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00edm p\u0159\u00edkladu byla vyu\u017eita inovativn\u00ed spektroskopick\u00e1 technika <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/ir-neascopes\/\"><strong>IR-SNOM<\/strong><\/a> spole\u010dnosti Attocube (Neaspec) pro anal\u00fdzu 3D nano kachni\u010dek vytisknut\u00fdch z\u00a0kopolymeru polystyrenu a polymethylmethakryl\u00e1tu: PS\/PMMA. Tato technika vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 vibrac\u00ed t\u011bchto polymer\u016f v\u00a0infra\u010derven\u00e9m spektru, kter\u00e9 umo\u017e\u0148uj\u00ed nejen p\u0159esnou identifikaci dan\u00e9ho polymeru, ale i imaging kopolymeru s\u00a0prostorov\u00fdm rozli\u0161en\u00edm a\u017e 10 nanometr\u016f.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12087\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12087\" style=\"width: 635px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12087 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/102d7869.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"635\" height=\"364\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/102d7869.png 635w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/102d7869-300x172.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 635px) 100vw, 635px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12087\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Porovn\u00e1n\u00ed infra\u010derven\u00fdch spekter \u201e\u010dist\u00fdch\u201c polymer\u016f PS a PMMA s vyzna\u010den\u00edm vibrac\u00ed pou\u017eit\u00fdch pro jejich <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/ir-neascopes\/\">nanoimaging<\/a> v kopolymeru.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12089\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12089\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12089 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/07a26bee.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"598\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/07a26bee.jpg 800w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\